    `Huber loss <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Huber_loss>`_ for more information.

    For a batch of size :math:`N`, the unreduced loss can be described as:

    .. math::
        \ell(x, y) = L = \{l_1, ..., l_N\}^T

    with

    .. math::
        l_n = \begin{cases}
        0.5 (x_n - y_n)^2, & \text{if } |x_n - y_n| < delta \\
